SUMMARY:Earth Day Concert and Silent Auction benefiting MountainTrue
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Earth Day with fellow nature lovers at this FREE Earth Day event packed with mountain spirit! \n Free Live Music – Kick back and enjoy performances from talented local musicians. (Musicians include:  Wild Roots\, Gill Francis\, David Cheatham\, Clawfoot\, Sunnie Rae\, and Hayley Renae). \n Silent Auction: Art for a Cause – Browse and bid on unique pieces from local artists. Every winning bid helps protect our region’s natural beauty. (Artists include: Monyu Jones\, Madi Lion Art\, Mary Rivera Art\, & Christina Wilson Art and many more…) \n Learn & Connect – Stop by the MountainTrue info table to learn how you can get involved in protecting our rivers\, forests\, and communities. \n Give Back While You Celebrate – All donations and silent auction proceeds go directly to MountainTrue\, supporting their work to keep our mountains wild and healthy. \nBring your friends\, your family\, and your love for the outdoors—let’s celebrate Earth Day the right way! \nHuge thanks to Argot Room for donating the event space for the event. \nThis event is being organized by a MountainTrue supporter and is not organized by MountainTrue staff directly. Please join us in thanking the local musicians and artists donating their time and talent to support MountainTrue.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/earth-day-concert-and-silent-auction-benefiting-mountaintrue/
LOCATION:The Argot Room at Jargon
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_4967-e1776584992388.webp
END:VEVENT
