SUMMARY:Artist ReLeaf Jam Wednesdays
DESCRIPTION:Hey Friends\, Lovers of Jazz\, & Beyond. Come Jam with Isaac & friends every Wednesday at LEAF Global in downtown AVL. They play an hour set and then it opens for a jam. We would love to see ya’ll there starting off a New Year with some great music. The community is invited to listen\, explore\, and find your voice within the Jazz Idiom and all branches of the musical web. $5.00 suggested donation. Drinks available for purchase.
