SUMMARY:Earth Day Concert w/ Murphy Campbell
DESCRIPTION:  \n  \nMurphy Campbell is nationally recognized\, known throughout Western North Carolina for her heartfelt blend of traditional Appalachian folk\, mountain ballads\, and acoustic storytelling music rooted in the rich musical heritage of our region. Her performances weave together guitar\, vocals\, and narrative song in a way that honors the land\, community\, and shared human experience. Drawing from Appalachian traditions while offering fresh interpretations\, Murphy’s music reflects themes of creation\, resilience\, and connection — making it a meaningful celebration of Earth Day.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/earth-day-concert-w-murphy-campbell/
LOCATION:Alexander Chapel United Methodist Church\, 880 Aiken Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28804\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
